  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/JadeWarrior_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You meditate on your jade, letting it enhance your senses to make you more aware of your surroundings.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn:</p><ul><li><p>You gain a bonus to your <strong>Training</strong> in <strong>Perception</strong> equal to your <strong>Training</strong> in <strong>Metaphysics</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Your <strong>Awareness</strong> increases by half your <strong>Training</strong> in <strong>Metaphysics</strong>, rounded up.</p></li><li><p>You can sense the presence of living creatures within a number of spaces equal to <strong>2</strong> <strong>* your</strong> <strong>Soul</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
